{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","亡血恩赐"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，将布阵在身前1格的友军转化为“吸血鬼眷属”。主动释放时，召唤鲜血法阵对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，苔佩希消耗自身10%生命值将布阵在身前1格的友军转化为“吸血鬼眷属”。“眷属”的攻击距离强制降低至1，受到非亡灵眷族的治疗减少90%，但获得苔佩希50% + 5%初始攻击力，50% + 5%初始生命值和25% + 2%伤害减免，每秒失去3%生命值并等量治疗苔佩希。“眷属”存活时，苔佩希造成伤害的30% + 3%会转化为对自身和“眷属”的治疗。主动使用时，苔佩希消耗10%当前生命值，以“眷属”为中心展开持续6秒的鲜血法阵，并使“眷属”进入6秒“鲜血渴望”状态，提升60 + 6点急速和60 + 6点汲取，法阵每秒对周围2格的敌人造成64% + 8% ATK伤害，并在结束时额外造成320% + 40% ATK真实伤害，法阵持续期间，范围内敌人每损失10%生命值便生成1颗血珠，最多生成12颗，每颗血珠会使法阵结束伤害提升10%。战场上不存在“眷属”时，苔佩希会将自身视为“眷属”。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":82,"end":87,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":96,"end":101,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":110,"end":115,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":157,"end":162,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":241,"end":245,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg16"},{"start":251,"end":255,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg17"},{"start":276,"end":281,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":301,"end":307,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":273,"end":285,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":297,"end":311,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至68% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg9"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","鲜血法阵每秒造成伤害提升至72% + 8% ATK，法阵结束时造成的真实伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"